From 197ecf1b9a8661ebc83e69b038f9e9eb6d84ea6f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 02:08:04 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(queen): answer a snapshot relay only about the Cell its
 link proved

The Cell gate handed every CellSnapshotRequest/CellRollbackRequest to the Queen's snapshotter by
the cell_id the request named, so any attached Cell could snapshot or roll back another. The link's
refusals now answer a relay request only about the Cell its handshake proved; any other is
answered with an error, never reaches the snapshotter, and is recorded as guard.relay_refused
(reason another_cell), once per link. The Guard Bee's new relay_forgery rule counts it, a shipped
dire pattern. Also declares guard.task_refused and its judged task_claim rule, which the Queen's
refusal of a Warden's report about another Cell's task (next commit) records.

Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01EKZW22X7GB1ADCG4ApBsA8
